Quest 367 "80Lv skill"
    Journal for karus "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Archmage] Drake."
    Journal for elmorad "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Archmage] Drake."
    Collect 15 of 810369000

Requires player level >= 80

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "Magic is the greatest ability created by man. You are well qualified to employ the ultimate magic. Is it time for another archmage to join the club..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "To learn lv.80 skill, you need 15 [Spell Stone Powder]. Are you ready to learn the ultimate spell?"

On in_progress
    Say "To complete the lv.80 mage spell, you need 15 [Spell Stone Powder]."

On ready
    Say "Master, all the items needed to complete Level 80 have been collected. Hurry back to [Archmage] Drake."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You now possess Fire Vampiric, incineration, Freezing Distance, and Blink, Level 80 skills. For a mage, this is as good as it gets."
